; The sequel world's layer (worlds/sequel/world.tres): a variant of the frozen layer, a drowned sea-wall iced over with brine.
; The frozen rime turned sea-green, the cold blue light turned teal, lamps of sodium amber in a green-black haze, cut stone
; under the ice (the flooded cathedral's masonry, not the archive's stacks).

